  <text>
    <body>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-475-490"><rb>直</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-490-522">らぬ病、身は痩せぬ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-522-531">思へる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-531-546"><rb>仲</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-546-552">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-552-570"><rb>今日</rb><rt>けふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-570-584">よりか、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-584-602"><rb>明日</rb><rt>あす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-602-634">か、君には厭はれむ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-634-672">かく思ふとき日は暮れて、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-672-693">こほろぎすだく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-693-717"><rb>磯際</rb><rt>いそぎは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-717-722">の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-722-755">破れし船に泣き伏しぬ。</seg></p>
    </body>
